# Vault server — suggestions

When a service, cron, or route detects an anomaly, gap, or improvement opportunity, call **`SuggestionService`** — do not only log.

```javascript
const { capture, captureIf, makeFingerprint } = require('../services/SuggestionService');

await captureIf(condition, {
  userId,
  source: 'serviceName',
  category: 'alert',
  fingerprint: makeFingerprint('serviceName', 'stable-key'),
  title: '…',
  body: '…',
  context: '…',
});
```

See `docs/suggestions-inbox.md` and `server/services/SuggestionService.js`.
